{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":638049,\"title\":\"Berg: Wozzeck\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Based on real events and drawing on Georg Büchner's revolutionary play, Alban Berg's Wozzeck turns a grimly tragic narrative of violence and murder into one of the most powerful and original operas of the 20th century. Berg's uncompromising portrayal of brutality and madness generated much controversy, but the significance of Wozzeck was soon recognised; its compelling lyrical expansiveness, large-scale dramatic gestures and remarkable musical structures producing music of overwhelming emotional intensity. The Financial Times declared this to be 'a beautiful, moving, engrossing production… this is a consummate Wozzeck, blending clarity, lyricism, compassion and crushing force.'\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rBuVWf0mVO9SgkbbCfcZVfPlvjx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c044y4RebIxs1kAHXRq6GeaT2bA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2018,\"runtime\":107,\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"François Roussillon\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1187134,\"name\":\"François Roussillon\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x3ff2xnNg34MrMzZRU4d24DzNpS.jpg\"},{\"id\":585995,\"name\":\"Christopher Maltman\",\"character\":\"Wozzeck\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aCmXtIudNh5K2nY65GAsZX105yt.jpg\"},{\"id\":1047182,\"name\":\"Eva-Maria Westbroek\",\"character\":\"Marie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zZUpfmddyLN6sUSSDgeKeAgOX6Q.jpg\"},{\"id\":2428767,\"name\":\"Marcel Beekman\",\"character\":\"Captain/Madman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1134317,\"name\":\"Willard White\",\"character\":\"Doctor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bsq1Sw3uJJUmKXa34LEtLi0kEIC.jpg\"},{\"id\":2428768,\"name\":\"Jason Bridges\",\"character\":\"Andres\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2428769,\"name\":\"Ursula Hesse von den Steinen\",\"character\":\"Margret\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2428770,\"name\":\"Scott Wilde\",\"character\":\"First Apprentice\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2383465,\"name\":\"Morschi Franz\",\"character\":\"Second Apprentice\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2009006,\"name\":\"Jacob Jutte\",\"character\":\"Marie's Son\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u9qRwDvlQZ0zmexNq9es5fWHVq7.jpg\"},{\"id\":2428771,\"name\":\"Richard Prada\",\"character\":\"A Soldier\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":342473,\"title\":\"Ballerina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qBxMhcmNnFniuDAZTKEHcSgKtsn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wlLdcK3Sm7zp0w1ZuVvnFlmcchM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1879 Paris, a young orphan dreams of becoming a ballerina and flees her rural Brittany for Paris, where she passes for someone else and accedes to the position of pupil at the Grand Opera house.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1038263,\"title\":\"Maria\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3oQRG0bwPUqE4N4n8z2kAzr7e40.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9iw4a6AQkxUO3EuRn59Vgrqf0zO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Maria Callas, the world's greatest opera singer, lives the last days of her life in 1970s Paris, as she confronts her identity and life.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76115,\"title\":\"The Phantom of the Opera at the Royal Albert Hall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xYqpJl7XWENDfIy3CqtO8klHOTX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hjmKqTwOIwN52RBGM72bLSq9Gay.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A disfigured musical genius, hidden away in the Paris Opera House, terrorises the opera company for the unwitting benefit of a young protégée whom he trains and loves. The 25th anniversary of the first public performance of Phantom of the Opera was celebrated with a grand performance at the Royal Albert Hall in London.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14353,\"title\":\"Repo! The Genetic Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2G5LczM1clXu3byEudWk9w0KDYD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xLH9jvY4tNzcKvopgEGYI7YeAy7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"By the year 2056, an epidemic of organ failures has devastated the planet. The megacorporation GeneCo provides organ transplants on a payment plan — and those unable to fulfill their plans have their organs repossessed. In the midst of this, a sickly teenager discovers a shocking secret about herself, her father, and their connection to GeneCo.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":352157,\"title\":\"Marguerite\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lfIleyisIzYfvUNXTLIfJjHiJz6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qJy1TAgMi0FmPVmrjedgfri63kc.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Paris in the 1920s. Marguerite Dumont is a wealthy woman with a passion for music and the opera. For years, she has performed regularly for a circle of guests. But Marguerite sings tragically out of tune and no one has ever told her. Her husband and her close friends have always encouraged her in her illusions. Things become very complicated the day she gets it into her head to perform in front of a genuine public, at the Opera.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843891,\"title\":\"The Pirates of Penzance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vfteQBo7igcmfHNFJeaO16aqvpr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sasha Regan’s award-winning All-male Company are set to lift everyone’s spirits with a treat in their new West End pirate’s cove. The swashbuckling pirates and their winsome lasses sail into the Palace Theatre with their inventive new take on W. S. Gilbert & Arthur Sullivan’s classic operetta THE PIRATES OF PENZANCE. Featuring a dazzling cast singing songs including: “I am a Pirate King”; “Oh, happy day, with joyous glee” and “A rollicking band of pirates we”, they are sure to raise the roof off the Palace Theatre!\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272306,\"title\":\"Rossini: La cenerentola\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yJIVoi7HN1l7e2h7COyx2VKfGYF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3cW6FEsqlEr88nkwVPaPhWzzcaY.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In late 18th-century Italy, in the mansion of Don Magnifico, the young and pretty Angelina works as a maid. Teased by her two frivolous half-sisters, Clorinda and Tisby, Angelina believes she is in love with a young valet and goes to the ball. Dressed in her finest finery, she meets the man who is in fact the Prince and flees from him after giving him a bracelet that will allow him to recognise her a little later. The masks come off, and kindness and love triumph!\\r ‘La Cenerentola’ is the last opera buffa composed by Gioachino Rossini for an Italian audience. A dramma giocoso in two acts, with a libretto by Jacopo Ferretti, freely adapted from Charles Perrault’s fairy tale ‘Cinderella’ (1697), omitting the magic in favour of a realism tinged with humour and social criticism. Premiered for the Rome Carnival at the Teatro Valle in Rome on 28 January 1817. Recorded live at Glyndebourne Opera, Lewes, East Sussex, on 2 and 4 June 2005.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272294,\"title\":\"Giacomo Puccini: Gianni Schicchi\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tk4XTQA17wvefVkpAvsEKZAwANn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b69nMPBvU7FCGQiz8bvrSTtvkBn.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the mid-20th century, in Fucecchio, near Florence, Buoso Donati, an elderly collector and wealthy antique dealer, has just passed away. He lies in his bed, surrounded by relatives feigning grief. They are all worried, as the deceased has bequeathed his entire fortune to a monastery. They search frantically for the will. The young Riniccio, Donati’s nephew, finds it but agrees to show it to the family only if they promise to let him marry Lauretta, the daughter of Gianni Schicchi, a local figure of dubious reputation. Everyone accepts the condition and discovers to their horror that the rumour was true: the monks are set to inherit the fortune. Riniccio suggests calling on Schicchi for help, much to the family’s disgust. Summoned, Riniccio arrives at the house accompanied by his daughter. He proposes keeping the death a secret, taking his place, and instructing a doctor and a notary to alter ‘his’ testamentary dispositions. But has the hunter become the hunted? Not so sure...\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":647953,\"title\":\"Semele\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bZ8QLDL9snqjpzBtkzOIH94Auqx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m7bvPBFXegf8aNMHhr8tHyzhD6R.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Opera superstar Cecilia Bartoli offers her first operatic release on DVD in 12 years, and also her first opera in English. Bartoli stars as Semele (a role usually taken by a soprano) in Handel s late opera, which features such well-known arias as Endless pleasure, endless love, Myself I shall adore, and Oh sleep, why dost though leave me? Robert Carsen s stylish modern dress production hints at parallels with the problematic relationship between the late Princess Diana and the British Royal Family. Recorded live at the Zurich Opera House in January, 2007.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270390,\"title\":\"Aida - Arena di Verona\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6803bD2lWtt05yNWkpeBSn4Esm0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5oNLpR9AtxS965FSBlpae6RNQ2h.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The grand scale and magnificent acoustics of the Roman arena in Verona are ideally suited to the pageantry of Verdi's Egyptian opera, presented here in a staging that is true to the original 1913 production, framed by obelisks and sphinxes and filled with chorus and dancers. Chinese soprano Hui He has won international acclaim for her portrayal of the eponymous slave girl whose forbidden love for the war hero Radamés (Marco Berti, the experienced Verdi tenor) brings death to them both.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":650771,\"title\":\"Lucia di Lammermoor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oilmRXudPKgazAfLYotx9UTS9ap.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Diana Damrau’s reputation as the world’s leading coloratura soprano has been built on her extraordinary technical virtuosity, her sensitive musicianship and her acute psychological insight. In this DVD of Katie Mitchell’s sometimes radical production of Lucia di Lammermoor from London’s Royal Opera House, she is, as the Financial Times wrote, “brilliantly convincing”. The British award winning director Katie Mitchell – took a revisionist approach to the drama, updating the action to the mid-19th century and applying a feminist slant as she added new and unexpected elements. The Financial Times wrote: “Mitchell shows us on stage personal traumas that a self-respecting woman in the early 19th century was meant to keep to herself. It is a messy, bloody list — nocturnal sex trysts, a knife murder, a miscarriage, a suicide in the bath … In all this Damrau is brilliantly convincing. Her rebellious Lucia is a woman of modern attitudes stuck in a still feudal Victorian world.”\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":650855,\"title\":\"Gianni Schicchi\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9jgOAOdv5YDgoJVQbXzKHE2KBVR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Woody Allen's production of the Puccini comic opera at LA Opera in 2015\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"w9k7AOpnnRE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Wijn957aMkA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"JYLNlvdDjNM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}